\ End-to-end exercise of a user-defined struct under runtime-image AOT.
\ Covers definition, raw constructor, positional unwrap, predicate. The
\ constructor and predicate words push the StructType as a typed
\ literal; each push must route through the runtime-image slot table.

point: struct{ x y } ;

\ Raw constructor + positional unwrap.
2 3 make-point unmake-point + .

\ Predicate distinguishes instances from foreign values.
4 5 make-point point? .
"not-a-point" point? .

\ Positional unwrap of an instance built with a different fixnum
\ payload exercises a second slot-table push from the constructor.
99 -1 make-point unmake-point + .
